{"seq":2,"slug":"instance-segmentation","title":"实例分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/instance-segmentation","wordCount":1127,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"实例分割\">实例分割</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实例分割在语义分割的基础上进一步区分同类别的不同实例。它为每个独立的物体实例生成一个精确的像素级掩码，同时输出该实例的类别标签和置信度。实例分割结合了目标检测（实例定位）和语义分割（像素分类）的能力，是场景理解中最具挑战性的任务之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入图像] --&gt; B{方法路线}&#10;    B --&gt; C[自上而下]&#10;    B --&gt; D[自下而上]&#10;    C --&gt; E[先检测后分割]&#10;    D --&gt; F[先分割后聚类]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Mask R-CNN]&#10;    F --&gt; H[嵌入聚类]&#10;    G --&gt; I[实例掩码]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph LR\n    A[输入图像] --&gt; B{方法路线}\n    B --&gt; C[自上而下]\n    B --&gt; D[自下而上]\n    C --&gt; E[先检测后分割]\n    D --&gt; F[先分割后聚类]\n    E --&gt; G[Mask R-CNN]\n    F --&gt; H[嵌入聚类]\n    G --&gt; I[实例掩码]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>实例分割有两条主要技术路线。自上而下方法先通过目标检测器定位每个实例的边界框，再在每个框内进行二值分割。自下而上方法先对每个像素预测嵌入向量，然后通过聚类将属于同一实例的像素分组。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>骨干网络</th>\n<th>COCO AP</th>\n<th>FPS</th>\n<th>核心特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mask R-CNN</td>\n<td>自上而下</td>\n<td>ResNet-50-FPN</td>\n<td>37.1</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>RoI Align + 掩码头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cascade Mask</td>\n<td>自上而下</td>\n<td>ResNet-50-FPN</td>\n<td>39.6</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>级联检测 + 掩码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLACT</td>\n<td>自上而下</td>\n<td>ResNet-50</td>\n<td>29.8</td>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>实时原型掩码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CondInst</td>\n<td>自上而下</td>\n<td>ResNet-50-FPN</td>\n<td>37.5</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>动态卷积核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mask2Former</td>\n<td>统一方法</td>\n<td>Swin-L</td>\n<td>50.1</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>掩码注意力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mask-r-cnn-架构\">Mask R-CNN 架构</h2><p>Mask R-CNN 是实例分割的奠基性工作，在 Faster R-CNN 的基础上添加了一个并行的掩码预测分支。对于每个检测到的实例，掩码分支在 RoI Align 提取的特征上预测一个固定大小（通常 28×28）的二值掩码。掩码分支独立于分类和回归分支，使用二值交叉熵损失训练。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torchvision&#10;from torchvision.models.detection import maskrcnn_resnet50_fpn_v2&#10;from torchvision.models.detection import MaskRCNN_ResNet50_FPN_V2_Weights&#10;&#10;model = maskrcnn_resnet50_fpn_v2(weights=MaskRCNN_ResNet50_FPN_V2_Weights.COCO_V1)&#10;model.eval()&#10;&#10;dummy = torch.randn(3, 800, 600)&#10;with torch.no_grad():&#10;    predictions = model([dummy])&#10;    masks = predictions[0][&#39;masks&#39;]&#10;    labels = predictions[0][&#39;labels&#39;]&#10;    scores = predictions[0][&#39;scores&#39;]&#10;    print(f&quot;检测到 {len(masks)} 个实例&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;掩码形状: {masks[0].shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision.models.detection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maskrcnn_resnet50_fpn_v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision.models.detection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MaskRCNN_ResNet50_FPN_V2_Weights</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maskrcnn_resnet50_fpn_v2(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MaskRCNN_ResNet50_FPN_V2_Weights.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COCO_V1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model([dummy])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    masks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictions[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'masks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictions[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'labels'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictions[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scores'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"检测到 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(masks)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 个实例\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"掩码形状: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">masks[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Mask R-CNN 的关键设计决策是掩码分支对每个类别独立预测掩码（K 个类别生成 K 个掩码），而不是所有类别共享一个掩码。这种类别无关的掩码预测解耦了分类和分割任务，显著提升了性能。RoI Align 的精确空间对齐对掩码质量至关重要——使用 RoI Pooling 会导致掩码边缘出现明显的量化伪影。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Mask R-CNN&#10;        A[输入图像] --&gt; B[FPN 特征金字塔]&#10;        B --&gt; C[RPN 候选区域]&#10;        C --&gt; D[RoI Align]&#10;        B --&gt; D&#10;        D --&gt; E[分类头]&#10;        D --&gt; F[回归头]&#10;        D --&gt; G[掩码头]&#10;        E --&gt; H[类别]&#10;        F --&gt; I[边界框]&#10;        G --&gt; J[28x28 掩码]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Mask R-CNN\n        A[输入图像] --&gt; B[FPN 特征金字塔]\n        B --&gt; C[RPN 候选区域]\n        C --&gt; D[RoI Align]\n        B --&gt; D\n        D --&gt; E[分类头]\n        D --&gt; F[回归头]\n        D --&gt; G[掩码头]\n        E --&gt; H[类别]\n        F --&gt; I[边界框]\n        G --&gt; J[28x28 掩码]\n    end</pre><p>PointRend 将实例分割的掩码精修建模为渲染问题。它不是对整个掩码区域均匀预测，而是在不确定的边界区域自适应地采样更多点进行精细预测。这种策略使得掩码在物体边缘处更加精确，同时减少了不必要的计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"yolact-与实时实例分割\">YOLACT 与实时实例分割</h2><p>YOLACT（You Only Look At CoefficienTs）开创了实时实例分割。它的核心思想是将掩码生成分解为两个并行任务：全局的原型掩码生成和逐实例的系数预测。最终掩码通过原型掩码的线性组合得到。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class YOLACTHead(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, num_protos=32, num_classes=80):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.proto_net = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, 256, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(256, 256, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(256, num_protos, 1),&#10;        )&#10;        self.coeff_head = nn.Conv2d(in_channels, num_protos, 1)&#10;        self.class_head = nn.Conv2d(in_channels, num_classes, 1)&#10;        self.box_head = nn.Conv2d(in_channels, 4, 1)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, feature):&#10;        protos = torch.sigmoid(self.proto_net(feature))&#10;        coeffs = torch.tanh(self.coeff_head(feature))&#10;        classes = self.class_head(feature)&#10;        boxes = self.box_head(feature)&#10;        return protos, coeffs, classes, boxes\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> YOLACTHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, num_protos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_classes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.proto_net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_protos, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.coeff_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(in_channels, num_protos, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.class_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(in_channels, num_classes, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.box_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(in_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, feature):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        protos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sigmoid(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.proto_net(feature))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        coeffs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.tanh(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.coeff_head(feature))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        classes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.class_head(feature)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        boxes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.box_head(feature)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> protos, coeffs, classes, boxes</span></span></code></pre></div><p>YOLACT 的速度优势来自于原型掩码是全局共享的，不需要像 Mask R-CNN 那样对每个实例单独进行 RoI 操作。SOLOv2 采用了另一种思路：将实例分割转化为位置感知的语义分割，通过动态卷积核为每个网格位置生成掩码。CondInst 使用条件卷积（动态生成的卷积核）进一步提升了掩码质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mask2former-统一框架\">Mask2Former 统一框架</h2><p>Mask2Former 提出了统一的掩码分类框架，将语义分割、实例分割和全景分割统一为相同的架构。它使用一组可学习的 queries 通过掩码注意力（Masked Attention）与图像特征交互，每个 query 预测一个掩码和对应的类别。</p>\n<p>Mask2Former 的核心创新是掩码注意力：在交叉注意力中，每个 query 只关注其预测掩码覆盖的图像区域，而不是全局注意力。这使得 queries 能够聚焦于各自负责的实例区域，提升了分割精度并加速了收敛。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import Mask2FormerForUniversalSegmentation, Mask2FormerImageProcessor&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;processor = Mask2FormerImageProcessor.from_pretrained(&quot;facebook/mask2former-swin-base-coco-instance&quot;)&#10;model = Mask2FormerForUniversalSegmentation.from_pretrained(&quot;facebook/mask2former-swin-base-coco-instance&quot;)&#10;model.eval()&#10;&#10;dummy = torch.randn(1, 3, 800, 800)&#10;with torch.no_grad():&#10;    outputs = model(pixel_values=dummy)&#10;    print(f&quot;掩码: {outputs.masks_queries_logits.shape}&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;类别: {outputs.class_queries_logits.shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Mask2FormerForUniversalSegmentation, Mask2FormerImageProcessor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">processor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Mask2FormerImageProcessor.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"facebook/mask2former-swin-base-coco-instance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Mask2FormerForUniversalSegmentation.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"facebook/mask2former-swin-base-coco-instance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pixel_values</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"掩码: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">outputs.masks_queries_logits.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"类别: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">outputs.class_queries_logits.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>统一框架</th>\n<th>实例 AP</th>\n<th>语义 mIoU</th>\n<th>全景 PQ</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mask R-CNN</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>37.1</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>实例专用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mask2Former</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>50.1</td>\n<td>57.7</td>\n<td>57.8</td>\n<td>三任务统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OneFormer</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>49.0</td>\n<td>57.4</td>\n<td>58.0</td>\n<td>单模型三任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((实例分割))&#10;    自上而下&#10;      Mask R-CNN&#10;      PointRend&#10;      Cascade Mask&#10;    实时方法&#10;      YOLACT&#10;      SOLOv2&#10;      CondInst&#10;    统一框架&#10;      Mask2Former&#10;      OneFormer\">mindmap\n  root((实例分割))\n    自上而下\n      Mask R-CNN\n      PointRend\n      Cascade Mask\n    实时方法\n      YOLACT\n      SOLOv2\n      CondInst\n    统一框架\n      Mask2Former\n      OneFormer</pre><ul>\n<li>实例分割结合了检测和分割能力，为每个物体实例生成精确的像素级掩码</li>\n<li>Mask R-CNN 通过在 Faster R-CNN 上添加掩码分支建立了实例分割的标准框架</li>\n<li>RoI Align 对掩码质量至关重要，避免了 RoI Pooling 的量化误差</li>\n<li>YOLACT 通过原型掩码+系数分解实现了实时实例分割</li>\n<li>Mask2Former 统一了语义、实例和全景分割三大任务</li>\n<li>实际项目中，精度优先选 Mask2Former，速度优先选 YOLACT 或 YOLOv8-seg</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实例分割","id":"实例分割"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Mask R-CNN 架构","id":"mask-r-cnn-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"YOLACT 与实时实例分割","id":"yolact-与实时实例分割"},{"level":2,"text":"Mask2Former 统一框架","id":"mask2former-统一框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语义分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/semantic-segmentation"},"next":{"title":"全景分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/panoptic-segmentation"}}